    "explanation": "Orphea is a strong pick on snowball maps. She excels on maps with important bosses, like Sky Temple and Tomb of the Spider Queen, because her Eternal Feast is excellent in these situations. However, her lack of single-target PvE damage makes her a poor choice on maps like Battlefield of Eternity. As long as another hero can claim Mercenary Camps, she remains a reasonable pick on most maps."
