  "builds": [
    {
      "name": "Standard Build",
      "label": "Recommended",
      "description": "This build is the most consistent build of them all, it can be used in any game, against any composition. The recommended Heroic is Eternal Feast, however, Crushing Jaws can also be picked to cancel a channeled ability, like Mosh Pit.\n\nAt level 4 Allegrissimo can be chosen if the opposing team does not have any ways to quickly burst Orphea, and if she can consistently hit Shadow Waltz on a large target, like on Deathwing or Diablo. At Level 16 Lurking Terror can be chosen if Orphea's team needs better follow-up on a backliner, like on Hanzo or Valla.",
