    {
      "name": "Chomp Build",
      "label": "Beginner",
      "description": "Orphea's Chomp Build has the best survivability among all Builds, and it is the best for beginners, as its damage is not reliant on hitting Shadow Waltz or Dread. However, it is terrible against enemies with high range, as it requires proximity to them to be useful.\n\nThis build has 2 main power spikes, the first one being on level 7, with Insatiable, which boosts Orphea's damage significantly. The second one is on level 13 with Abyssal Symbiosis, enhancing her survivability. After those levels, it is important to be take advantage of those strengths and focus on punishing enemies that are close to Orphea, as the extra shield and heal ensures that she will survive if not stunned or outnumbered.",
