      "name": "Aram Build",
      "label": "ARAM",
      "description": "Orphea's Aram Build is focused on high-range burst damage. To excel using this build, Orphea should focus on quickly completing her 2 quests, Growing Nightmare and Mind Devourer. Since Mind Devourer gets stacks from both the wave and explosion of Dread, it is always better to make sure that the wave will hit. Therefore, it is better to always aim Dread behind enemies.",
